Details and practical steps
- High‑importance uses that generally require an exact match:
  - Employment verification (I-9), payroll/W‑2 setup, tax filings, SSA/benefits, passport or government ID requests, background checks, credit/loan underwriting. A mismatch can cause verification failures, processing delays, or rejected applications.
